  /*
   * THE REVIEW-DATE LINE. Five of the eight posts open with an italic
   * "Last reviewed: 26 July 2026", which is metadata wearing a paragraph's
   * clothes. Set as a mono meta line it stops competing with the standfirst
   * below it, and nothing in the markdown had to change to say so.
   *
   * THE RECIPE IS GONE FROM HERE, 2026-08-04, A-48. It is a `.meta` line, but
